I recently took a wizard to level 6 or 7 without leaving dungeon level 1
or so.

How?

	find sink with toxic waste.
	quaff until metamorphosis
	quaff until Water Elemental summoned
	kill Water Elemental
	repeat.

Since I became big and nasty (e.g., a Fire Elemental), I destroyed the
Water Elemental with the first blow or two.  Net result: I would gain a
level every few moves.

BTW: I never knew water could burn.  Although it was fun watching the
extremely low-level (and dumb) monsters attack an elemental.

I died a short while later when I returned to human form (without any
armor) -- I had gone exploring the next level.  I was also curious if
this would be a permanent change.

So is this in the same class as the Troll dance of death?  Or even better,
since even a first-level wizard can pull it off?

Or is this something that is expected to get past the 7th or so level?


